                <p>Douglas MacArthur II, formerly Counselor of
                    Embassy at Paris, succeeded Charles E.
                        Bohlen as Counselor of the Department of State on Mar. 30,
                    1953.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d170-f4" n="4" xml:id="d170-f4-content">
                <p>Harold E. Stassen succeeded W. Averell Harriman as Director for Mutual
